@startuml
title Allocating a Vault V2 into a Vault V1 through MorphoVaultV1Adapter
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF5FF
  ParticipantBorderColor #4A78B5
  LifeLineBorderColor #4A78B5
}
actor Allocator
participant VaultV2 as V
participant MorphoVaultV1Adapter as AD
participant "Vault V1" as V1
participant "Morpho Blue" as B
Allocator -> V : allocate(adapter, "", assets)
V -> V : accrueInterest()\nsum of realAssets()
V -> AD : transfer(assets)
V -> AD : allocate("", assets, selector, sender)
AD -> V1 : deposit(assets, adapter)
V1 -> B : supply along the supply queue
note right of V1 : reverts AllCapsReached\nif caps are full
V1 --> AD : V1 shares
AD -> V1 : previewRedeem(balance)
AD --> V : ([adapterId], newAllocation - oldAllocation)
V -> V : allocation[adapterId] += change
V -> V : check absolute and relative caps
@enduml
